<title>UK: Moody's says may cut 38 deals supported by JPM.</title>
<headline>Moody's says may cut 38 deals supported by JPM.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moody's Investors Service said on Tuesday it placed under review for possible downgrade the rating of 38 structured transactions which are fully or partially supported by JP Morgan subsidiaries.</p>
<p>&quot;These reviews are prompted by the review for possible downgrade of the long term counterparty ratings of JP Morgan &amp; Co. Incorporated and Morgan Guaranty Trust Co. of New York,&quot; Moody's said in a statement.</p>
</text>
